# Rolls-Royce Silver Ghost (40/50 h.p.), 1907-1925.
#
# The 40/50 h.p. "Silver Ghost": 7,036-7,428 cc sidevalve six, chassis wheelbase
# 3,442 mm, overall dimensions body-dependent (about 4,800 x 1,700 x 1,800 mm as
# a London-Edinburgh tourer). About 7,874 built, the class-4 benchmark of the
# 1910s and the model that established Rolls-Royce's reputation.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rolls-Royce_Silver_Ghost
#
# Colours: Black, Dark Green, Maroon and Grey are documented period finishes.
#
# Weight: 15 in total (black 6, green 4, maroon 3, grey 2). Section F of the gaps
# doc: early prestige models are representative only.
#
# Speed 110 km/h; comfort 60/420 (line). Class 4.
# Dates: 1907-1925 with a road tail to about 1938.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/rolls-royce-silver-ghost.blend. References:
# citycars/references/rolls-royce-silver-ghost/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia
# Commons.
#
# Gate C, 2026-11-16: accepted as built. The pack photographs only the front from
# four angles, so the rear and the exact side are estimated from the published
# chassis dimensions: wheel diameter 0.940 m, track 1.440 m, plain open rear tub,
# no unreferenced lamps or luggage. Body is the open tourer of the photographs, not
# the closed limousine that appears in one image. No correction round.

obj=citycar
name=RollsRoyceSilverGhost(Black)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=6
intro_year=1907
intro_month=7
retire_year=1938
retire_month=6
speed=110
length=3
class=4
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=60
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=420

Image[E]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_S.0.0,0,0
Image[SW]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_SW.0.0,-8,12
Image[W]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_W.0.0,4,5
Image[NW]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_NW.0.0,12,10
Image[N]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_N.0.0,0,33
Image[NE]=./images/rolls-royce-silver-ghost-black_NE.0.0,0,24
